msgid "<if ($n2 > 0)>The collectable item <noun-en Item 3 $n1 1 1><else><capitalize><noun-en Item 1 $n1 1 1></capitalize></if> will be printed on the canvas. Proceed?<br><if ($n2 > 0)>※Items with the lowest collectability are prioritized for printing.<br></if><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>※HQ items and collectables will be rendered normal.</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br><br>The following item will be discarded:</ui-edge-color></ui-color>"
