msgctxt "Addon:7123:0:0"
msgid "The results period has ended. Your claim to this plot of land has been forfeit. Additionally, a cancellation fee of 50% will be deducted from your deposit. Accept the remaining refund of <kilo $n1 \",\"> gil?<br>※Refund available until <set-time $n2><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if>."
msgstr "Срок подтверждения покупки участка истёк. Из залога вычтут штраф за отмену — 50%. Получить оставшуюся сумму: <kilo $n1 \",\"> гил?<br>※ Возврат доступен до <set-time $n2><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> в <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min>."

#. ja: 当選番号は<num $n1>です。<br>落選しました。<br><kilo $n2 ",">ギルが返還されます。<br>受け取りますか？<br><br>※返還期限：<set-time $n3><num $year>/<num $month>/<num $day> <num $hour>:<num2 $min>まで
#. de: Die Gewinnzahl ist <num $n1>. Diesmal war dir das Glück leider nicht hold. Möchtest du die Rückerstattung über <kilo $n2 "."> Gil erhalten?<br><br>※ Die Rückerstattung ist bis <set-time $n3><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> um <num $hour>:<num2 $min> Uhr möglich.
#. fr: Le numéro gagnant est le... <num $n1>. Dommage, mais la prochaine fois sera peut-être la bonne<nbsp>! Voulez-vous confirmer le remboursement de <kilo $n2 "<nbsp>"> <if ($n2 <= 1)>gil<else>gils</if><nbsp>?<br><br>Période de remboursement<nbsp>: jusqu'au <set-time $n3><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> à <num $hour>h<num2 $min>
