#. macro: <num $year> — a number; value = year of the set time (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "Addon:7124:0:0"
msgid "The winning number is...<num $n1>. May you have better luck in the future!<br><br>Accept a full refund of your deposit of <kilo $n2 \",\"> gil?<br>※Refund available until <set-time $n3><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min> <if ($hour >= 12)>p.m.<else>a.m.</if> <if ($gn77 == 3)><num $day>/<num $month>/<num $year><else><num $month>/<num $day>/<num $year></if>."
msgstr "Выигрышный номер: <num $n1>. Удачи в следующий раз!<br><br>Получить полный возврат залога — <kilo $n2 \",\"> гил?<br>※ Возврат доступен до <set-time $n3><num $day>.<num $month>.<num $year> в <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{12}</if>:<num2 $min>."

#. ja: 結果発表から90日の返還期間が過ぎているため、<br>ギルは返還されませんでした。
#. de: Deine Gil können nicht rückerstattet werden, da die Rückerstattungsfrist von 90 Tagen überschritten wurde.
